From 3404b67c54fe5768dbd33eb011e30410107f9c3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 20:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] art: true 16x16 terrain metatiles, new field palettes,
 NPC/window redraw

Terrain is now authored as real 16x16 art (grass tufts, outlined trees/
bushes, pebbled path, waves+sparkle water, tan brick walls) instead of
pixel-doubled 8x8. Field palettes reworked: ground greens+brown, water
blues+white, deco palette (gold/red) for flowers and the NPC (who now
stands on grass instead of a black square), walls share the window
palette as brick. Window frame redrawn as a thick 2px bevel-rounded
Dragon-Quest-style border.
---
 src/chr.s           |  80 +++++------
 src/field.s         |  28 ++--
 src/main.s          |   8 +-
 tools/gen_assets.py | 320 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------------
 4 files changed, 279 insertions(+), 157 deletions(-)

